## 2026-09-30 — SRS Revision 180: «برامجنا التعليمية» as an educational journey
- One model (`journey-model.ts`) from `GET /programs`, two views: a sideways-scrolling road that CLIMBS right to left (every cell `--step` higher; rise scaled to the catalogue), shoe-print walks between stops (one SVG sole symbol, rotated to the direction of travel, revealed print by print on scroll behind `journey--animate`, still under reduced motion — guard `check-journey-css.sh`), a category sign at each junction, a direct-entry path from outside into every later Category's FIRST step, a graduation hut after each Category's last step, the summit; and «عرض جميع البرامج», a dialog of the same data (`programs-text-view.tsx`), focusable at a Level from a card's «التفاصيل».
- Model (migration `20260930100000_r180_level_age_range_and_journey_role`): `level.min_age`/`max_age` (CHECK 0–120, never inverted) and `level.journey_role` (`step` | `preparatory`); `category.min_age`/`max_age` dropped after carrying each Category's range onto its first/last live Level. `policies/age-range.ts` derives a Category's range (first Level's start; the LAST Level's end, strictly — none → open-ended) for `/programs`, «الفئات» and the calendar bootstrap; the registration forms read it unchanged. «المستويات» asks the ages and the role; «الفئات» no longer asks ages.
